      "text": [
        "Wedding photography, told honestly",
        "Documentary-style wedding photography across the Cotswolds — quiet moments, real laughter, and the light exactly as it fell that day.",
        "Cotswolds & Beyond"
      ]
    },
    {
      "top": 927,
      "height": 860,
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "Hello, I'm Laura",
      "cards": 0,
