      "carousel": false,
      "figures": 0,
      "text": [
        "Hello, I'm Laura",
        "I've spent the last nine years photographing weddings in the fields, farmhouses and honey-stone villages of the Cotswolds — and I still get the same flutter of excitement every single time.",
        "My approach is unobtrusive. I'm not one for lengthy posed line-ups; instead, I spend the day watching for the moments that actually matter — your dad's hands shaking as he does up your buttons, the speech that goes slightly wrong, the first dance you didn't rehearse enough. Those are the photographs",
        "I shoot on film and digital, work with a small and considered kit so I can move quietly through your day, and I always arrive with tea, not an agenda.",
        "Laura x"
      ]
    },
