      "text": [
        "From couples I've walked alongside",
        "\"Laura disappeared into the background all day and somehow still caught everything. We cried looking through the gallery — it felt exactly like being back there.\"",
        "Charlotte & James, Barnsley House",
        "\"We were dreading the 'photo bit' of the day and Laura made it the easiest part. Fifteen minutes, a laugh about the wind, and the results were stunning.\"",
        "Emily & Tom, Cripps Barn",
        "\"Not a single posed, stiff photo in the whole gallery. It's just us — our families, our friends, our actual wedding day.\"",
        "Hannah & Sam, Stow-on-the-Wold"
      ]
    },
